---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy notice — Wisdom Technosoft"
  description="How Wisdom Technosoft handles the details you share through this website — and what we do not collect."
  noindex={true}
  hasRuler={false}
  bodyClass="stub"
>
  <header class="stub-head">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Wisdom Technosoft home">
      <img src="/assets/logo-mark.png" alt="" class="brand-logo" width="36" height="30">
      <span class="brand-name">Wisdom Technosoft</span>
    </a>
    <a class="stub-back" href="/">&larr; Back to site</a>
  </header>

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="stub-main">
    <div class="w stub-container">
      <div class="privacy-box grid-frame">
        <div class="crosshair crosshair-tl"></div>
        <div class="crosshair crosshair-tr"></div>
        <div class="crosshair crosshair-bl"></div>
        <div class="crosshair crosshair-br"></div>

        <div class="stub-top-meta">
          <span class="eyebrow">LEGAL // TRANSPARENCY</span>
          <span class="blueprint-tag">NO TRACKERS &bull; NO SURVEILLANCE</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="sec-title">Privacy notice.</h1>

        <p class="lead-prose">Wisdom Technosoft (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;) respects your privacy. This notice explains what happens to the information you share through <strong>wisdomtechnosoft.com</strong> and our contact form. It does not cover how we handle client project data once an engagement begins &mdash; that is governed by the specific master services agreement between us and the client.</p>

        <h2 class="stub-h">What we collect</h2>
        <ul class="stub-list">
          <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, optional phone number, chosen service and your message. These are used only to respond to your inquiry.</li>
          <li><strong>Email and phone:</strong> if you write to <a href="mailto:wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com" class="lnk">wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+917447331127" class="lnk">+91 74473 31127</a>, your message and reply history are retained for correspondence.</li>
          <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> like most websites, our hosting provider records standard request data (IP address, timestamp, requested URL, user-agent) for security and reliability. These are not used for advertising or cross-site profiling.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="stub-h">What we do not do</h2>
        <ul class="stub-list">
          <li>No advertising or third-party marketing cookies.</li>
          <li>No invasive surveillance scripts (Meta Pixel, etc.).</li>
          <li>No selling, renting or sharing of your information with third parties for marketing.</li>
          <li>No automated decision-making based on your inquiry.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="stub-h">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>Contact-form submissions and correspondence are kept for as long as needed to respond to your inquiry and, if a project begins, for the duration of that project and any statutory record-keeping requirement. You may ask us to delete your inquiry at any time.</p>

        <h2 class="stub-h">Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the information you have sent us by writing to <a href="mailto:wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com" class="lnk">wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com</a>. We will respond within a reasonable time and no later than 30 days.</p>

        <h2 class="stub-h">Security</h2>
        <p>The website is served over HTTPS. We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information against loss, misuse and unauthorized access.</p>

        <h2 class="stub-h">Changes</h2>
        <p>If this notice changes in a way that affects how we handle your information, we will update the date below and, where appropriate, notify you.</p>

        <p class="stub-nav">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-10-26">26 October 2026</time> &middot; Wisdom Technosoft, Nagpur, Maharashtra, India &middot; <a href="/" class="lnk">Back to site</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .stub {
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .stub-head {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-inline: var(--g);
    height: var(--nav-h, 70px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .brand-name {
    font-family: var(--disp);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .stub-back {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .stub-main {
    padding-block: 60px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .stub-container {
    max-width: 860px;
  }
  .privacy-box {
    padding: 48px;
    background: var(--surface-card);
  }
  .stub-top-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .lead-prose {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .stub-h {
    font-family: var(--disp);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .stub-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  p {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .stub-nav {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .privacy-box {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
